WEBVTT

00:00:18.370 --> 00:00:21.770
So now Brother Helmut's 
married into a knightdom, too.

00:00:21.770 --> 00:00:25.520
That's how it was for you two as well, right?

00:00:25.520 --> 00:00:33.190
The only reason anyone would want to marry 
us is to become your relative, honestly.

00:00:33.190 --> 00:00:37.140
No, I'm sure that's not the only reason.

00:00:37.140 --> 00:00:39.540
Well, you'd better accept it already.

00:00:39.880 --> 00:00:42.720
You're drawing the entire nation's attention.

00:00:42.720 --> 00:00:46.510
You need to make a decision about the 
tournament soon, or you'll embarrass yourself.

00:00:46.890 --> 00:00:48.360
Tournament?

00:00:48.690 --> 00:00:50.280
Haven't you heard about it?

00:00:50.280 --> 00:00:54.070
It's a martial arts tournament the kingdom 
hosts once every three years.

00:00:54.410 --> 00:00:57.080
I imagine you'll be 
participating this time, too.

00:00:57.080 --> 00:00:58.880
Huh? I will?

00:00:58.880 --> 00:01:02.560
It's established that all nobles 
will participate at least once.

00:01:02.560 --> 00:01:04.530
Then I'll enter the mage division.

00:01:04.530 --> 00:01:05.550
There isn't one.

00:01:05.550 --> 00:01:06.250
Huh?

00:01:06.490 --> 00:01:11.210
There's only swordsmanship, spearmanship, 
archery, and hand-to-hand.

00:01:11.210 --> 00:01:16.450
But a noble must earn respect for 
their splendid use of the sword.

00:01:16.450 --> 00:01:17.890
So that settles it.

00:01:17.890 --> 00:01:19.680
You'll be in the swordsmanship division.

00:01:21.380 --> 00:01:22.640
I see...

00:01:25.820 --> 00:01:28.810
Then I'll enhance my body with magic.

00:01:28.810 --> 00:01:31.060
Use of magic is forbidden.

00:01:31.060 --> 00:01:33.800
It's a contest of pure skill, after all.

00:01:33.800 --> 00:01:36.180
What? But that's...

00:01:36.830 --> 00:01:39.990
<i>I wish there was a kitchen knife division.</i>

00:01:59.970 --> 00:02:09.150
The 8th Son?
 Are You Kidding Me?

00:01:59.970 --> 00:02:09.150
The 8th Son?
 Are You Kidding Me?

00:01:59.970 --> 00:02:09.150
The 8th Son?
 Are You Kidding Me?

00:01:59.970 --> 00:02:09.150
The 8th Son?
 Are You Kidding Me?

00:01:59.970 --> 00:02:09.150
The 8th Son?
 Are You Kidding Me?

00:01:59.970 --> 00:02:09.150
The 8th Son?
 Are You Kidding Me?

00:01:59.970 --> 00:02:09.150
The 8th Son?
 Are You Kidding Me?

00:01:59.970 --> 00:02:09.150
The 8th Son?
 Are You Kidding Me?

00:03:10.500 --> 00:03:15.460
Episode 7
No Magic? Are You Kidding Me?!

00:03:24.800 --> 00:03:26.960
You always give up so quickly.

00:03:26.960 --> 00:03:28.770
Come on, stand up!

00:03:29.100 --> 00:03:32.960
Hey, why don't we try a different regimen?

00:03:32.960 --> 00:03:34.290
Huh? Why?

00:03:34.290 --> 00:03:36.700
Because I've been training 
with you every day

00:03:36.700 --> 00:03:40.900
for these past six months while you 
enhance your bodies with magic.

00:03:40.900 --> 00:03:42.870
I can't keep up anymore.

00:03:42.870 --> 00:03:43.740
I'm at my limit.

00:03:44.440 --> 00:03:47.200
I don't have as much magic as Louise, either.

00:03:47.430 --> 00:03:51.920
Still, when you use your magic, you're stronger 
than the old man who taught you, right?

00:03:51.920 --> 00:03:54.090
That's incredible enough!

00:03:54.090 --> 00:03:56.190
While I'm... I'm just...

00:03:56.190 --> 00:03:57.710
Hey, it's Well.

00:04:01.550 --> 00:04:05.130
Huh? Did he have somewhere 
to go after the ceremony?

00:04:05.130 --> 00:04:08.640
He mentioned he needed to 
talk to Cardinal Hohenheim.

00:04:10.200 --> 00:04:11.270
Jeez...

00:04:11.520 --> 00:04:13.660
Why don't I have any...

00:04:18.150 --> 00:04:22.810
...talent for magic?!

00:04:34.640 --> 00:04:37.080
We should participate in the 
martial arts tournament?

00:04:37.080 --> 00:04:42.200
Your lord said to put up a fight 
worthy of a retainer's daughter.

00:04:42.200 --> 00:04:45.800
If you make it through the preliminaries,
 that should be enough.

00:04:45.800 --> 00:04:49.260
That's impossible! It's forbidden
 to use magic there!

00:04:49.870 --> 00:04:56.730
But if you lose in the first round, 
you'll bring shame on your lord.

00:04:59.690 --> 00:05:01.400
Huh? Where are you going?

00:05:02.610 --> 00:05:04.460
To train without using magic.

00:05:09.170 --> 00:05:11.540
What, you don't need to train, boy?

00:05:12.140 --> 00:05:15.000
Even if I'm defeated, I have nothing to lose.

00:05:15.000 --> 00:05:17.400
Nothing to lose, huh?

00:05:17.400 --> 00:05:22.460
Could you still say that if you were 
removed from your adventuring party?

00:05:22.460 --> 00:05:24.560
Huh? Hold on a minute.

00:05:24.560 --> 00:05:26.200
Why would they cut me out?

00:05:26.200 --> 00:05:30.030
You're all two years away from turning 
15, which will make you adults.

00:05:30.030 --> 00:05:32.540
From then on, you'll officially be adventurers.

00:05:32.540 --> 00:05:36.120
But before then, it's only natural to let go

00:05:36.120 --> 00:05:38.440
of people who can't pull their weight.

00:05:39.790 --> 00:05:42.940
No way. We're connected at our souls.

00:05:43.410 --> 00:05:45.530
Don't be so naïve.

00:05:46.950 --> 00:05:48.560
Party members are comrades

00:05:48.560 --> 00:05:52.430
who entrust each other with their lives 
in order to achieve their goals.

00:05:52.430 --> 00:05:54.950
Feelings alone won't cut it.

00:05:54.950 --> 00:05:58.420
To be honest, I swapped out party 
members a few times myself.

00:05:58.420 --> 00:06:00.920
But still, Well would never...

00:06:00.920 --> 00:06:04.060
Anyway, just make sure you're 
not seen as a hindrance.

00:06:07.220 --> 00:06:08.490
This is good!

00:06:08.490 --> 00:06:10.140
What is this black paper?

00:06:23.940 --> 00:06:25.400
Nori's so good!

00:06:25.730 --> 00:06:29.110
That reminds me. You're also participating 
in the tournament, aren't you?

00:06:29.110 --> 00:06:29.870
Yeah.

00:06:29.870 --> 00:06:32.540
And I picked up some information about that.

00:06:33.350 --> 00:06:36.730
Word has it that the winner 
of the past two tournaments,

00:06:36.730 --> 00:06:38.830
Warren, the Commander of the Royal Knights,

00:06:38.830 --> 00:06:42.290
is withdrawing his entry to help 
cultivate the next generation.

00:06:42.290 --> 00:06:45.380
What?! Then victory's already ours!

00:06:45.380 --> 00:06:48.840
No, it's not. It just means 
it'll be a little easier.

00:06:51.640 --> 00:06:56.800
Um, also, I had something to 
discuss with all of you... uh...

00:06:57.190 --> 00:07:00.020
It's about our adventuring party.

00:07:01.510 --> 00:07:04.960
That's what I was meeting 
Cardinal Hohenheim about today.

00:07:05.370 --> 00:07:08.390
I was actually hoping we 
could add Elise to our party.

00:07:09.620 --> 00:07:11.320
I hope we can all get along.

00:07:13.800 --> 00:07:16.980
Oh, yeah, that's completely fine.

00:07:16.980 --> 00:07:20.510
I mean, having her with us will 
be a big bonus for our party.

00:07:20.510 --> 00:07:23.790
She does bring healing magic 
to our party, after all.

00:07:24.500 --> 00:07:26.880
Want to enter the tournament 
with us while you're at it?

00:07:26.880 --> 00:07:28.440
That does sound fun...

00:07:28.440 --> 00:07:31.970
But there's no division I could enter.

00:07:33.200 --> 00:07:34.580
You're okay with it too, right, Er?

00:07:35.280 --> 00:07:37.260
Yeah, of course.

00:07:37.260 --> 00:07:38.820
That's great.

00:07:38.820 --> 00:07:41.230
Now I can focus on the martial arts tournament.

00:07:41.440 --> 00:07:44.710
Huh? I'm surprised you're 
that interested in it.

00:07:44.710 --> 00:07:47.150
My goal is to not embarrass myself!

00:07:47.930 --> 00:07:49.860
In that case, I'm going to win.

00:07:51.940 --> 00:07:54.280
I'll be sure to win it!

00:08:03.120 --> 00:08:05.860
Hey, wait! Wait a minute!

00:08:08.790 --> 00:08:10.810
What's gotten into him?

00:08:10.810 --> 00:08:12.130
Jeez!

00:08:17.790 --> 00:08:19.260
I'll win!

00:08:19.530 --> 00:08:23.680
Twenty-six, twenty-seven...

00:08:21.730 --> 00:08:24.520
Twenty-eight, twenty-nine...

00:08:24.520 --> 00:08:28.400
Twenty-eight, twenty-nine...

00:08:26.930 --> 00:08:28.400
S-Seven...

00:08:28.400 --> 00:08:32.240
Ninety-six, ninety-seven...

00:08:32.960 --> 00:08:37.450
Ninety-eight, ninety-nine, victory!

00:08:55.080 --> 00:08:56.430
Victory!

00:09:09.200 --> 00:09:10.860
They're all incredible.

00:09:11.970 --> 00:09:12.860
Yes.

00:09:25.940 --> 00:09:29.710
It's annoying hearing "victory" 
over and over, but maybe...

00:09:29.710 --> 00:09:31.880
Yeah, he might actually win it.

00:09:32.370 --> 00:09:33.840
Victory!

00:09:37.300 --> 00:09:39.910
Warren's going to be in the
 martial arts tournament?

00:09:39.910 --> 00:09:42.730
Apparently, the king told him that if he 
wanted to cultivate the next generation,

00:09:42.730 --> 00:09:45.850
he should become a hurdle 
for them to overcome,

00:09:46.140 --> 00:09:47.330
so now he's entering.

00:10:08.220 --> 00:10:10.580
You're not doing your nightly training?

00:10:12.670 --> 00:10:16.120
Yeah, I'm not feeling so great.

00:10:16.550 --> 00:10:19.970
Giving up now that Warren's entering?

00:10:20.520 --> 00:10:24.470
Have either of you seen Warren's matches?

00:10:27.140 --> 00:10:28.670
He's incredible.

00:10:28.670 --> 00:10:31.500
There's a reason he climbed all the way up to

00:10:31.500 --> 00:10:35.170
Commander of the Royal Knights despite
being the third son of lesser nobility.

00:10:35.530 --> 00:10:37.460
He's already guaranteed to win.

00:10:37.460 --> 00:10:39.940
But even if you don't win...

00:10:39.940 --> 00:10:43.690
No way. Since I don't have any talent for magic,

00:10:43.690 --> 00:10:47.980
I need to produce results like that,
 or I'll just be a hindrance.

00:10:47.980 --> 00:10:51.920
None of us consider you a hindrance.

00:10:52.180 --> 00:10:55.880
People with a talent for magic 
couldn't understand how I feel.

00:10:57.540 --> 00:10:58.610
Is that so?

00:11:31.410 --> 00:11:32.260
Well?

00:11:38.340 --> 00:11:41.420
Hey, Well, I just want to make sure...

00:11:41.810 --> 00:11:45.890
You wouldn't do anything 
like remove me from the party

00:11:45.890 --> 00:11:50.580
if I don't happen to win the 
martial arts tournament, right?

00:11:54.480 --> 00:11:55.630
Huh? What...

00:11:56.130 --> 00:11:58.690
Hey, wake up! Jeez!

00:12:01.130 --> 00:12:03.660
Sorry, Elise! I fell asleep 
while waiting for you...

00:12:03.660 --> 00:12:06.660
Elise? Would you wake up already?

00:12:06.660 --> 00:12:07.890
Er!

00:12:08.800 --> 00:12:13.830
Oh, well, apparently she's been feeling 
anxious about joining our party.

00:12:14.080 --> 00:12:18.800
Why? Elise would be plenty of 
help with her healing magic.

00:12:18.800 --> 00:12:20.550
It's her physical abilities.

00:12:20.820 --> 00:12:24.640
She's hasn't trained and honed her 
body like the rest of us have,

00:12:25.510 --> 00:12:28.100
so she's worried that she'll hinder us one day.

00:12:31.290 --> 00:12:32.590
One...

00:12:32.590 --> 00:12:34.950
So lately, she's been at it every day.

00:12:35.390 --> 00:12:39.230
She doesn't want to worry everyone else, 
so she trains in secret early in the mornings.

00:12:41.520 --> 00:12:44.980
I guess everyone has insecurities,
even the ones who seem perfect.

00:12:45.650 --> 00:12:47.240
So, did you need something?

00:12:47.520 --> 00:12:48.370
Oh, yeah.

00:12:49.050 --> 00:12:52.640
I'm going to win that tournament, 
so make sure you watch.

00:12:52.640 --> 00:12:53.660
Later.

00:13:04.600 --> 00:13:08.970
I'm sorry for being so preoccupied with myself.

00:13:09.260 --> 00:13:11.180
Today I'm going to win!

00:13:11.820 --> 00:13:13.810
I'm not going to lose!

00:13:18.800 --> 00:13:20.400
All right!

00:13:35.330 --> 00:13:38.850
You secured awfully good seats.

00:13:38.850 --> 00:13:43.050
But only the finals will be conducted here.

00:13:43.990 --> 00:13:47.510
We'll have to pray everyone makes 
it through the preliminaries first.

00:13:55.540 --> 00:13:58.960
Um, if you're interested,
I brought this for all of you.

00:13:58.960 --> 00:14:00.770
Huh? A lunch box?

00:14:01.350 --> 00:14:02.140
Thank you!

00:14:02.140 --> 00:14:03.110
Yahoo!

00:14:03.390 --> 00:14:06.950
All right, it's almost time to 
head to the preliminary arena.

00:14:08.500 --> 00:14:09.810
Ow!

00:14:09.810 --> 00:14:11.440
Were you asleep?

00:14:11.440 --> 00:14:13.620
You're as carefree as ever.

00:14:13.840 --> 00:14:17.880
Feel free to come back here if you lose.

00:14:17.880 --> 00:14:21.080
We'll welcome you all with open arms.

00:14:21.330 --> 00:14:23.040
Okay, let's go!

00:14:25.010 --> 00:14:29.720
Wendelin! Wendelin! Wendelin!

00:14:32.370 --> 00:14:33.290
Huh?

00:14:35.500 --> 00:14:37.090
<i>Warren?!</i>

00:14:38.320 --> 00:14:41.520
<i>My first match is against Warren?!</i>

00:14:41.780 --> 00:14:43.990
<i>But my goal's still the same!</i>

00:14:43.990 --> 00:14:45.680
<i>Don't worry about victory!</i>

00:14:45.680 --> 00:14:47.990
<i>The most important thing...</i>

00:14:48.200 --> 00:14:50.710
<i>is putting up a fight</i>

00:14:52.960 --> 00:14:55.060
<i>that won't embarrass me!</i>

00:14:57.580 --> 00:14:58.180
Huh?!

00:15:13.970 --> 00:15:18.770
You came back so fast, it's like you 
were just out on a little shopping run!

00:15:18.980 --> 00:15:24.690
I hope Er and the other girls 
don't come back just as quickly.

00:15:26.420 --> 00:15:29.080
They won't be coming back that easily.

00:15:55.180 --> 00:15:56.720
Yeah!

00:16:02.850 --> 00:16:03.910
I'm back.

00:16:07.610 --> 00:16:10.920
I lost in the semifinal round 
of the preliminaries.

00:16:11.540 --> 00:16:12.440
I see.

00:16:13.040 --> 00:16:16.480
You did pretty well, considering your 
Magic Fist Style is at a disadvantage

00:16:16.480 --> 00:16:18.220
when magic is forbidden.

00:16:18.660 --> 00:16:21.000
I'm sure your lord will be satisfied.

00:16:30.140 --> 00:16:32.540
<i>If I win this one, I'll clear the preliminaries.</i>

00:16:36.550 --> 00:16:39.010
That sound... It can't be...

00:16:41.940 --> 00:16:43.910
The Spinning Spear guy?!

00:16:44.690 --> 00:16:48.290
Hmm? You're... with Sir Baumeister!

00:16:48.290 --> 00:16:51.900
Which means Sir Baumeister is 
somewhere here at this arena?!

00:16:56.050 --> 00:17:00.510
<i>Huh? This guy's surprisingly well defended!</i>

00:17:23.140 --> 00:17:27.700
My Spinning Spear shall reach Sir Baumeister!

00:17:36.640 --> 00:17:37.970
Good job out there.

00:17:37.970 --> 00:17:39.990
Iina?! What happened?!

00:17:40.960 --> 00:17:43.630
I lost the last match of the preliminaries.

00:17:43.630 --> 00:17:45.210
To the Spinning Spear guy.

00:17:45.210 --> 00:17:46.590
What?!

00:17:47.100 --> 00:17:50.540
So that street performer 
guy was actually strong?

00:17:50.800 --> 00:17:54.210
His name's Roderich, 
and he's more than just strong.

00:17:54.210 --> 00:17:58.220
He was raised by a merchant family, so he 
knows how to do most kinds of accounting.

00:17:58.220 --> 00:17:59.700
He knows the law, too.

00:18:00.260 --> 00:18:02.010
Hey, are you listening, Well?

00:18:04.450 --> 00:18:05.980
He's asleep, isn't he?

00:18:06.640 --> 00:18:10.400
I'm sorry. Apparently he didn't 
get much sleep last night.

00:18:10.640 --> 00:18:12.540
Last night? Why not?

00:18:13.780 --> 00:18:20.820
The lunch boxes I gave you all earlier 
were actually made by Wendelin.

00:18:29.490 --> 00:18:31.750
Winner: Erwin Von Arnim!

00:18:34.220 --> 00:18:35.960
Only one more match before the final—

00:18:48.240 --> 00:18:50.770
I'm looking forward to our match.

00:18:56.950 --> 00:18:58.900
You mustn't risk what might happen.

00:18:59.140 --> 00:19:01.220
You should forfeit now.

00:19:01.220 --> 00:19:04.740
But I promised I would win.

00:19:05.170 --> 00:19:07.760
I just heard from Brantag.

00:19:07.760 --> 00:19:10.030
He said he was a bit too harsh with you.

00:19:10.690 --> 00:19:12.210
No, it's the truth.

00:19:12.560 --> 00:19:14.610
I don't have any talent for magic,

00:19:14.610 --> 00:19:18.740
so it won't be that easy for me to 
remain a member of Well's party.

00:19:21.330 --> 00:19:24.430
I'm guessing you haven't looked 
at your lunch box yet, then.

00:19:25.430 --> 00:19:26.490
My lunch box?

00:19:28.480 --> 00:19:29.600
Go on, open it.

00:19:32.310 --> 00:19:34.520
our

00:19:32.310 --> 00:19:34.520
best

00:19:32.560 --> 00:19:34.520
do

00:19:32.690 --> 00:19:34.520
Let's

00:19:33.060 --> 00:19:34.520
!!

00:19:35.730 --> 00:19:40.700
Let's do our best!!

00:19:36.470 --> 00:19:40.260
Well was up late last night making these.

00:19:40.940 --> 00:19:43.910
He saw that we were all 
unusually excited for this,

00:19:43.910 --> 00:19:48.160
so he was trying to figure out 
what he could do to help us.

00:19:48.380 --> 00:19:52.510
What he eventually came up with was 
a lunch box to raise our spirits.

00:19:52.510 --> 00:19:55.710
Well will always be Well.

00:19:55.710 --> 00:19:58.170
Now and forever, probably.

00:19:58.450 --> 00:20:00.130
So don't overdo it.

00:20:02.590 --> 00:20:04.800
Let's

00:20:13.070 --> 00:20:13.980
Take this.

00:20:14.210 --> 00:20:16.440
Hey! Were you listening to us at all?!

00:20:18.500 --> 00:20:22.060
If a member of his party turned 
and ran before the enemy,

00:20:22.060 --> 00:20:23.930
Well would be a laughingstock, right?

00:20:25.700 --> 00:20:27.620
All right, I'll be back!

00:21:03.360 --> 00:21:06.820
Good for both of them, finding proper mentors.

00:21:07.140 --> 00:21:10.030
Er's getting to learn from Warren, no less.

00:21:10.560 --> 00:21:15.770
My mentor said he was willing 
to train you along with me, too.

00:21:15.770 --> 00:21:19.250
Looks like it'll be smooth sailing 
toward becoming adventurers!

00:21:19.520 --> 00:21:23.680
You're right. We need to make the 
most out of these next two years.

00:21:24.440 --> 00:21:28.720
Though... who <i>is</i> your mentor, anyway?

00:21:28.980 --> 00:21:29.700
Huh?!

00:21:30.470 --> 00:21:31.300
No way!

00:21:32.960 --> 00:21:35.490
I guess I imagined it.

00:21:35.490 --> 00:21:38.310
Sorry to keep you waiting!

00:21:38.590 --> 00:21:39.770
Muscles!

00:21:44.480 --> 00:21:46.190
Master!

00:21:46.190 --> 00:21:48.700
I had a feeling this might happen.

00:21:48.910 --> 00:21:55.660
Now, let's start a training regimen that will 
leave your mind and muscles trembling with joy!

00:21:56.020 --> 00:21:57.790
Follow me!

00:21:58.350 --> 00:22:00.550
Yeah! Let's go, Well!

00:22:03.460 --> 00:22:06.340
Fine, I'll do it! I'll become a musclehead!

00:22:03.910 --> 00:22:07.820
I'm going to train you up!

00:22:06.340 --> 00:22:07.820
Yeah!
